Corrected message:

Prevent opening two status-bar color pickers at once

The status bar's single-color picker is non-modal and had no
re-entry guard, so a second swatch click while one picker was open
raced the first when setting the color. A second click is now ignored
while a picker is open, matching the color panel's picker.

Also log the underlying exception when an add-in package fails to
load; the install dialog reported every failure (including permission
and IO errors) as a corrupt package with nothing logged.
